'''Flowers of Light''' is a light-type spell used to create glowing flowers.{{Ref|m|58|22-23}}

==Description==
This spell contains the decorative sigil for flowers, surrounded by unknown signs and a pentagon formation that also separates the sigils from each other.

==Usage==
Agott showed this spell to Coco while explaining decorative sigils. Coco mentioned its similarity to Qifrey's own flower of water that he made when she first came to the atelier.{{Ref|m|58|22-23}}

